      "title": "START HERE — ART FIRST, LETTERING LAST",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Illustrious 4-Panel Comic + Katori Lettering\\n\\nThis workflow generates four independent, text-free Illustrious panels, assembles the page, and then uses the real custom node `IllustriousComicLettering4Panel` for exact dialogue.\\n\\n### Required custom node\\nInstall **ComfyUI-IllustriousComicLettering** from `katorikonoe-ai/ComfyUI-IllustriousComicLettering`, then restart ComfyUI/Floyo.\\n\\n### Test order\\n1. Select an Illustrious XL checkpoint available in your environment.\\n2. Select a compatible character LoRA in LoRA A and update the identity block in all four prompts.\\n3. Keep LoRA B bypassed unless you deliberately select a compatible style LoRA.\\n4. Queue once and inspect four separately saved raw panels.\\n5. Reroll only failed branches. Lock good seeds by switching `randomize` to `fixed`.\\n6. Edit the four exact dialogue fields in the lettering node.\\n7. Save the final lettered page.\\n\\nNever ask diffusion to spell dialogue; the custom node handles it after page assembly."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -360,
        80
      ],
      "size": [
        400,
        720
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "CHARACTER + PROP CONTINUITY BIBLE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Yui identity lock\\n\\n- Trigger: `yuichan`\\n- Very long straight pure black hair\\n- Brown eyes\\n- Yellow sweater vest\\n- White short-sleeved collared shirt\\n- Green bowtie\\n- Green plaid pleated miniskirt\\n\\n## Repeated story props\\n\\n- One tiny blue bird\\n- One red watering can\\n- Pink greenhouse flowers\\n- Wooden worktable\\n\\nCopy identity and recurring props without changing their wording. Do not mention dialogue or bubbles in the diffusion prompts."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1800,
