      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "2 x 2 PAGE MAP — GENERATED BY COMPOSITOR",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 1600 x 2200 final page\\n\\n| Panel | Position | Normalized size |\\n|---|---:|---:|\\n| 1 | 60, 60 | 720 x 960 |\\n| 2 | 820, 60 | 720 x 960 |\\n| 3 | 60, 1120 | 720 x 960 |\\n| 4 | 820, 1120 | 720 x 960 |\\n\\nThe art model creates four ordinary single-frame images. Native `ImageCompositeMasked` nodes build the comic page. The custom lettering node then overlays deterministic bubbles and returns both the final image and a bubble mask."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -1120,
        840
      ],
      "size": [
        1160,
        660
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "PROMPT GUIDE — RESERVE SPACE, DO NOT DRAW WORDS",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Prompt rule\\n\\nEnd every art prompt with:\\n\\n`leave clean uncluttered negative space in the upper corner for later lettering, no speech bubble, no letters, no text`\\n\\nThe bubble is added only after all four panels have been assembled. Short dialogue of four to seven words is the safest range. If the art model produces accidental lettering, reroll the affected panel before the lettering stage."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
